  "title": "Loot Ledger",
  "description": "Turns the classic MMO item compendium from wow-classic-items into priced, rollable loot pools for dnd5e: sell prices that match the original vendor prices, rarity from item quality, roll tables by level band, quality, item type, mixed drop and creature type, and an optional 5e conversion of every item with a GM review list.",
